  "permanent_motion": "Panel 1: Very subtle vertical floating of the justice scale (amplitude 5px). Panel 2: Extremely slow zoom-in on the aerial schematic (scale 1.0 to 1.05). Panel 3: Mapbox camera performs a slow pan from Niger slightly northeast towards Moscow to emphasize the distance. Panel 4: Background beige is static, the stamp text remains fixed once slammed down, minor camera shake on impact.",
  "fidelity_warnings": "The animated line connecting Niger and Moscow must be calculated as a geodesic curve (great circle) using turf.js or similar to appear correctly curved on the 2D projection. Ensure Mapbox projection is set to 'mercator' to match standard Web Map bounds before drawing the SVG arc overlay.",
  "remotion_implementation_notes": "Use AbsoluteFill for all major panel layers. Implement spring animations using spring(fps, frame, {damping: 80, stiffness: 60}) with extrapolateRight: 'clamp' for pill pop-ups and the stamp slam effect (scaling from 3.0 down to 1.0). Pre-calculate Mapbox coordinates using project() methods for the SVG overlay dots and arc. Ensure mapbox layer uses premountFor={30} to prevent blank flash on transition. Mapbox constructor MUST include projection: { name: 'mercator' } — never omit or globe rendering activates by default."
}